 DA_YUN:['Decade cycles show how the natal structure enters different phases.','大运用来观察原局在不同人生阶段如何被带动。'],
 LIU_NIAN:['Annual context shows which existing themes become more active in a selected year.','流年用来观察某一年哪些原局主题更容易被带动。'],
